  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Given is a tree with NNN weighted vertices and N−1N-1N−1 weighted edges. The iii-th vertex has a weight of AiA_iAi​. The iii-th edge has a weight of WiW_iWi​ and connects vertices uiu_iui​ and viv_ivi​.\n\nLet dist⁡(x,y)\\operatorname{dist}(x,y)dist(x,y) be the sum of weights of the edges in the unique simple path connecting vertices xxx and yyy.\n\nLet V⁡(x,y)\\operatorname{V}(x,y)V(x,y) be the set of vertices appearing in the unique simple path connecting vertices xxx and yyy (including xxx and yyy).\n\nYou are asked QQQ queries. In the iii-th query, you are given two integers xix_ixi​ and yiy_iyi​ and you need to compute:\n\n∑k∈V⁡(xi,yi)(dist⁡(xi,k)−dist⁡(k,yi))⋅Ak\\sum\\limits_{k\\in \\operatorname{V}(x_i,y_i)}\\left(\\operatorname{dist}(x_i,k)-\\operatorname{dist}(k,y_i)\\right)\\cdot A_kk∈V(xi​,yi​)∑​(dist(xi​,k)−dist(k,yi​))⋅Ak​\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input contains a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line contains two integers NNN and QQQ.\nThe second line contains NNN integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1,A_2,\\dots,A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\nEach of the next N−1N-1N−1 lines contains three integers uiu_iui​, viv_ivi​ and WiW_iWi​.\nEach of the next QQQ lines contains two integers xix_ixi​ and yiy_iyi​.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each query, print the answer to it on a new line.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1031\\le T\\le 10^31≤T≤103",
      "2≤N≤2⋅1052 \\le N \\le 2\\cdot10^52≤N≤2⋅105",
      "1≤Q≤2⋅1051 \\le Q \\le 2\\cdot10^51≤Q≤2⋅105",
      "1≤Ai,Wi≤1041 \\le A_i,W_i \\le 10^41≤Ai​,Wi​≤104",
      "1≤ui,vi,xi,yi≤N1\\le u_i,v_i,x_i,y_i\\le N1≤ui​,vi​,xi​,yi​≤N",
      "xi≠yix_i\\ne y_ixi​=yi​",
      "ui≠viu_i\\ne v_iui​=vi​",
      "The sum of NNN across all test cases does not exceed 2⋅1052\\cdot 10^52⋅105.",
      "The sum of QQQ across all test cases does not exceed 2⋅1052\\cdot 10^52⋅105.",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask #1 (20 points):** ui=i,vi=i+1u_i=i,v_i=i+1ui​=i,vi​=i+1",
      "**Subtask #2 (80 points):** Original constraints"
    ],
